     "The Rattle book has just been published by Springer.\r<br>\r<br>The main Springer page is:\r<br>\r<br><a href=\"http://www.springer.com/alert/urltracking.do?id=L1cd4caM84d9b1Saad76d3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.springer.com/alert/urltracking.do?id%3DL1cd4caM84d9b1Saad76d3&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792479219100000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3-3TJt5jbupIqnYi_q89qE\">http://www.springer.com/alert/urltracking.do?id=L1cd4caM84d9b1Saad76d3</a>\r<br>\r<br>You can read it online (at least the first few pages of each chapter)\r<br>from:\r<br>\r<br><a href=\"http://www.springerlink.com/content/978-1-4419-9890-3#section=934546&amp;page=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.springerlink.com/content/978-1-4419-9890-3%23section%3D934546%26page%3D1&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792479219101000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3VcgwxrOuSBZ0fCfmltpUQ\">http://www.springerlink.com/content/978-1-4419-9890-3#section=934546&amp;page=1</a>\r<br>\r<br>And Amazon sell it from:\r<br>\r<br><a href=\"http://www.amazon.com/Data-Mining-Rattle-Excavating-Knowledge/dp/1441998896\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.amazon.com/Data-Mining-Rattle-Excavating-Knowledge/dp/1441998896&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792479219101000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1KQ4we6Hu8ve-DtBvKtHXh\">http://www.amazon.com/Data-Mining-Rattle-Excavating-Knowledge/dp/1441998896</a>\r<br>\r<br>Robert Muenchen, author of the extremely useful introductory R book &quot;R\r<br>for SAS and SPSS Users&quot; wrote a review of the book which I have\r<br>included on:\r<br>\r<br><a href=\"http://rattle.togaware.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rattle.togaware.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792479219101000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0QVNnf6uJsQuDjo2KnzYP7\">http://rattle.togaware.com/</a>\r<br>\r<br>I am also starting to publish &quot;recipes&quot; at:\r<br>\r<br><a href=\"http://rattle.togaware.com/rattle-examples.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rattle.togaware.com/rattle-examples.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792479219101000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0l1hxBQG9rQwPAQ-AbaPri\">http://rattle.togaware.com/rattle-examples.html</a>\r<br>\r<br>As always, feedback/comments are most welcome.\r<br>\r<br>Regards,\r<br>Graham"
